PROJECT TITLE : Library Management System

PROJECT DESCRIPTION :

The Library Management System is a web-based application developed
using Python and Flask. It helps manage library books, users, and
book issue and return activities in a simple and efficient way.


PROJECT OBJECTIVE :

The main objective of this project is to develop a simple system
for managing library books and user details digitally.

It helps to:
- Add and manage books
- Register users
- Login users
- Issue books
- Return books
- Check book availability
- Store library records


TECHNOLOGIES USED :
Programming Language : Python
Web Framework       : Flask
Frontend            : HTML, CSS
Database            : SQLite
Development Tool    : VS Code
Version Control     : GitHub

FRONTEND :
The frontend is designed using HTML and CSS.

Main pages:
- Login Page
- Registration Page
- Dashboard
- Book Management Page
- Add Book Page
- Issue Book Page
- Return Book Page


BACKEND :
Python Flask is used for backend development.

Backend functions include:
- User registration
- User login
- Session management
- Adding books
- Updating book status
- Issuing books
- Returning books
- Database operations


DATABASE :
SQLite database is used to store the application data.

Main tables:
- Users
- Books

Users table contains:
- User ID
- Username
- Password

Books table contains:
- Book ID
- Book Title
- Author
- Book Status


MAIN FEATURES :

1. User Registration
2. User Login
3. User Logout
4. Dashboard
5. Add New Book
6. View Books
7. Search Books
8. Issue Book
